## Architectural Map & Data Flow

### 1. Application Entry Point & Initialization
- **[index.html](file:///d:/anti%20sky/index.html)** serves as the single DOM document host.
- The document loads `<script type="module" src="/app.js">` at line 780.
- On `DOMContentLoaded`, **[app.js](file:///d:/anti%20sky/app.js)** runs:
  1. `initDatabase()`: Checks `localStorage` and seeds 6 collections with mock initial data if empty.
  2. `loadSession()`: Reads active user session from `sessionStorage.getItem('sky_session')`.
  3. `router()`: Triggers view section activation based on the current URL hash (defaults to `#home`).

### 2. Client-Side Database & Session Layer
- **Local Database Engine** (`localStorage`): Encapsulated by `dbGet(key)` and `dbSet(key, val)`.
  - Collections:
    - `sky_users`: Credentials and roles (`admin` vs `customer`).
    - `sky_services`: Service catalog items (e.g., Cold Pyro, Dry Ice, CO2 Confetti, Bride & Groom Entry).
    - `sky_bookings`: Customer booking requests with status pipeline (`pending` → `confirmed` → `completed` / `cancelled`).
    - `sky_gallery`: Public event showcase images tied to service categories.
    - `sky_testimonials`: Client feedback with moderation flags (`approved: true/false`).
    - `sky_enquiries`: General contact form inquiries with response tracking (`new` vs `responded`).
- **Session State**: Global `currentUser` object stored in `sessionStorage` (`sky_session`).

### 3. Hash Router & Route Guardians
- The router maps URL hashes to target `<section id="view-{route}">` elements:
  - `#home` → Hero section, service highlights teaser, public testimonials slider.
  - `#services` → Filterable service catalog grid.
  - `#gallery` → Event photo gallery.
  - `#book` → Service booking request form with auto pricing calculator.
  - `#contact` → Public contact form & company info.
  - `#login` → Auth views (Customer Login, Registration, Admin Login).
  - `#dashboard` → Customer account portal & booking history table.
  - `#admin` → Administrator console (Bookings, Services, Gallery, Moderation, Enquiries).
- **Route Guard Protection**: Blocks unauthorized navigation to `#admin` or `#dashboard` and redirects unauthenticated users to `#login`.

```mermaid
graph TD
    User([User Browser]) -->|URL Hash Change| Router[Hash Router - router()]
    Router -->|Check Role| Guard{Route Guard}
    
    Guard -->|Public Route| PublicViews[Home / Services / Gallery / Book / Contact]
    Guard -->|Unauthenticated Admin/Customer| AuthView[#login View]
    Guard -->|Authenticated Customer| CustomerDash[#dashboard View]
    Guard -->|Authenticated Admin| AdminDash[#admin View]

    PublicViews -->|Form Action| Storage[(localStorage - Mock DB)]
    CustomerDash -->|Book / Review / Cancel| Storage
    AdminDash -->|Approve / Modify Services / Moderate| Storage
    AuthView -->|Validate Credentials| Session[(sessionStorage - sky_session)]
```

