## Proposed Architectural Plan (For Future Development)

1. **Code Refactoring & Modularization**:
   - Split [app.js](file:///d:/anti%20sky/app.js) into modular ES modules under `src/`:
     - `src/db/` (Storage & initial seed data)
     - `src/router/` (Hash router & route guards)
     - `src/views/` (Component renders for Home, Services, Admin, Dashboard)
     - `src/utils/` (Form validation & toast notifications)
2. **Security Enhancements**:
   - Add input sanitization for user-generated content (testimonials, enquiries).
   - Implement hash-based password checking (e.g. SHA-256 via Web Crypto API) even for client-side storage simulation.
3. **Automated Testing Setup**:
   - Add Vitest for form validation & pricing logic unit testing.
